    "`status` uses the plan vocabulary: planned, in_progress, implemented_unverified, verified_local,",
    "accepted, blocked. `implemented_unverified` means the test exists and runs; it is not a verdict.",
    "A01-A36 are cross-layer acceptance cases from docs/implementation-next/ACCEPTANCE.vi.md and stay",
    "`planned` until their owner milestone implements them."
